---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { examplePackage, highlight } from '../lib/example';

const pkg = examplePackage();
const lines = highlight(pkg);
---

<ol class="flow" aria-label="What one click does">
  <li class="step">
    <p class="step-label"><span class="n">01</span> You're on a docs page</p>
    <div class="frame browser" role="img" aria-label="A browser showing docs.stripe.com/webhooks, with the scoop.md popup open and its Scoop to agent button">
      <div class="chrome">
        <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span class="url">docs.stripe.com/webhooks</span>
        <span class="ext-btn"><Logo size={16} /></span>
      </div>
      <div class="page">
        <div class="page-copy" aria-hidden="true">
          <b>Receive Stripe events in your webhook endpoint</b>
          <span class="l w90"></span>
          <span class="l w70"></span>
          <span class="l w80"></span>
          <b class="sub">Set up your endpoint</b>
          <span class="l w85"></span>
          <span class="l w60"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="popup">
          <span class="popup-btn">Scoop to agent</span>
          <span class="popup-note">Copied 135 KB of docs.stripe.com docs.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="step">
    <p class="step-label"><span class="n">02</span> Markdown lands on your clipboard</p>
    <figure class="frame clip">
      <div class="clip-bar">
        <span class="clip-title">clipboard <span class="muted">· 135 KB, excerpt</span></span>
        <button type="button" class="copy" data-copy-target="example-md">Copy</button>
      </div>
      <pre id="example-md" tabindex="0" aria-label="Example package for docs.stripe.com/webhooks"><code>{
        lines.map((parts) => (
          <span class="ln">{parts.map((p) => (p.cls ? <span class={p.cls}>{p.text}</span> : p.text))}{'\n'}</span>
        ))
      }</code></pre>
      <figcaption class="sr-only">
        The package starts with where it came from, a note telling the agent to treat it as reference, and the list of
        sources, followed by each source in full.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </li>

  <li class="step">
    <p class="step-label"><span class="n">03</span> Your agent builds with it</p>
    <div class="frame term" role="img" aria-label="A coding agent session: the user pastes the package and asks for a webhook route; the agent writes it using the pasted docs">
      <div class="term-bar"><span>coding agent</span><span class="muted">~/shop</span></div>
      <div class="term-body" aria-hidden="true">
        <p><span class="prompt">&gt;</span> <span class="paste">[Pasted text +1,536 lines]</span> Add a Stripe webhook route that verifies the signature and handles <code>checkout.session.completed</code>.</p>
        <p class="out"><span class="dot">●</span> Using the pasted docs.stripe.com reference (2 sources)</p>
        <p class="out"><span class="dot">●</span> Write <u>app/api/stripe/webhook/route.ts</u></p>
        <p class="out indent">stripe.webhooks.constructEvent(body, sig, secret)</p>
        <p class="out"><span class="dot">●</span> Test it: <code>stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/stripe/webhook</code></p>
        <p class="out ok">Done.<span class="caret"></span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </li>
</ol>

<script>
  for (const btn of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-copy-target]')) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const el = document.getElementById(btn.dataset.copyTarget!);
      if (!el) return;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(el.textContent ?? '');
        btn.textContent = 'Copied';
      } catch {
        // No clipboard access: select the text so Ctrl/Cmd+C works.
        getSelection()?.selectAllChildren(el);
        btn.textContent = 'Selected';
      }
      setTimeout(() => (btn.textContent = 'Copy'), 1800);
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .flow {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    align-items: start;
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .step {
    min-width: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Arrow between steps */
  .step + .step::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1 * clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.75rem));
    width: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
    top: 9.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font: 600 1.1rem/1 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .step-label {
    font: 500 0.875rem/1.3 var(--font-mono);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .n {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    margin-right: 0.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .frame {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--sheet);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 01: browser */
  .chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .dots i {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--muted);
  }

  .url {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font: 400 0.75rem/1.6 var(--font-mono);
    background: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 99px;
    padding: 0 0.6rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .ext-btn {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    outline: 2px solid var(--mark);
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .page {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 0.9rem 5.5rem;
    min-height: 15rem;
  }

  .page-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font: 700 0.95rem/1.2 var(--font-display);
  }

  .page-copy .sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .l {
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--rule);
  }

  .w60 { width: 60%; }
  .w70 { width: 70%; }
  .w80 { width: 80%; }
  .w85 { width: 85%; }
  .w90 { width: 90%; }

  .popup {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0.6rem;
    top: -2px;
    width: min(13.5rem, 80%);
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .popup-btn {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    font: 600 0.85rem/1 var(--font-body);
    padding: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--mark);
    color: var(--on-mark);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .popup-note {
    font: 400 0.7rem/1.35 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* 02: clipboard */
  .clip-bar,
  .term-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem 0.45rem 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font: 500 0.75rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);
  }

  .clip-title {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .copy {
    font: 600 0.75rem/1 var(--font-mono);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--mark);
    color: var(--on-mark);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem 1.5rem;
    max-height: 26rem;
    overflow: auto;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  pre .h {
    color: var(--syn-h);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  pre .q {
    color: var(--syn-q);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* The preamble is the safety rail; give it the highlighter. */
  pre .ln:has(.q) {
    display: block;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--mark);
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
    margin-left: -0.5rem;
  }

  pre .li {
    color: var(--syn-li);
  }

  pre .hr,
  pre .meta {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  pre .u {
    color: var(--syn-url);
  }

  /* 03: terminal */
  .term {
    background: #17110d;
    color: #f7efe9;
    border-color: var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .term .term-bar {
    border-color: #33271f;
  }

  .term .muted {
    color: #a8988b;
  }

  .term-body {
    padding: 0.9rem;
    font: 400 0.75rem/1.55 var(--font-mono);
    min-height: 15rem;
  }

  .term-body p {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .term-body code {
    font-size: 1em;
    color: #ff9911;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: #ff9911;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .paste {
    background: #33271f;
    padding: 0 0.3em;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .out {
    color: #d9cbc0;
  }

  .dot {
    color: #ff9911;
  }

  .indent {
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    color: #a8988b;
  }

  .ok {
    color: #f7efe9;
  }

  .caret {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.55em;
    height: 1.05em;
    vertical-align: -0.2em;
    margin-left: 0.3em;
    background: #ff9911;
    animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .step + .step::before {
      content: '↓';
      position: static;
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      text-align: left;
      margin: -0.5rem 0 0.75rem 0.4rem;
    }

    pre {
      max-height: 20rem;
    }
  }
</style>
